\par 
\par }{\fs28\cf6 Tallfellow Halflings
\par }{\b\fs24 Character point cost: 35
\par }{\fs24 These halflings are the tallest and slimmest of their kind, averaging a little over 4' tall. Their favorite locale is temperate woodlands. As such, they often live nearer to elves than humans.
\par \tab They usually wear their hair long, sometimes covered with small caps. And they tend to wear clothes of greens and tans to help them blend into the woods. Tallfellows are the best carpenters, and they often live in spacious above\_
ground wooden houses. When they need to travel, tallfellows prefer riding small ponies to walking.
\par \tab Most tallfellows are lawful good, but player characters can be of any alignment.
\par \tab }{\b\fs24\cf6 Languages:}{\fs24  Tallfellows begin with the following languages: common, halfling, elf, gnome, centaur and dryad.
