\par }{\fs28\cf12 Half-Elves}{\fs24   Half\_elves are the offspring of human and elf parents. They average 5 1/2' tall and weigh about 150 pounds. They possess elements of both parents\rquote 
 heritages, and can be the following classes: cleric, druid, fighter, ranger, mage, specialist wizard, thief, or bard. Multi\_
class combinations are: cleric (or druid)/fighter, cleric (or druid)/fighter/mage, cleric/ranger, cleric (or druid)/mage, fighter/mage, fighter/thief, fighter/mage/thief, and mage/thief.
\par \tab Half\_elves can be any alignment.
\par \tab Half\_elves comprise a single subrace (see below).
