\par 
\par }{\fs28\cf6 Selecting Weapon Proficiencies
\par }{\fs24 \tab Weapon proficiencies can be acquired when a character is first created, and additionally during the course of that character\rquote s adventuring career.
\par \tab A warrior (including multi\_classed warriors) must pay 2 character points for each weapon proficiency slot. A character who is not a warrior must spend 3 character points for each weapon proficiency slot.
