ul MTHAC0 roll. If the roll fails, the disease is too widespread in the victim\rquote s system. The user must continue spending 5 PSPs each round until he succeeds in activating the power. Note that a cure performed through this power doesn\rquote 
t automatically restore lost hit points. However, the user can heal up to 4 points of damage in each subsequent round by spending 5 PSPs per hit point recovered (4 hit points for 20 PSPs per round maximum). The user can\rquote 
t cure a disease and restore hit points during the same round.
