t choose the appearance. The change takes several seconds to occur. As the user moves, the coloration shifts to reflect any changes in the surroundings.
\par \tab This power makes the user extremely difficult to spot. For every round the power is in effect and the user remains still, he can avoid detection simply by successfully rolling against the power\rquote 
s MAC. If the user moves, the MAC score increases (to MAC 5). Chameleon power is most effective in natural surroundings, where the user\rquote 
s coloration can best conceal him. In an urban setting, or in an area without natural cover during broad daylight, the power\rquote s MAC score is improved to MAC 3.
