reatures or characters who are also on the Astral Plane can see it. A silvery cord connects the astral body to the physical one. This translucent string stretches 10 feet from the astral body before becoming invisible. If the cord is severed, both the ast
ral and physical bodies die\emdash killing the user. The cord is nearly indestructible, however. It only can be severed by a powerful psionic wind or the }{\i\fs24 silver sword}{\fs24  of a githyanki.
