quick transit system, carrying travelers to a destination chosen by the user. A gleaming portal appears in front of him. At the same time, an identical portal appears wherever the user wants it (within the power\rquote 
s range). The door can have any orientation desired. Stepping into either portal allows a character to immediately step out of the other. Both doors remain in place as long as the PSP cost is met.
\par \tab A door has only one side and no thickness; it doesn\rquote t exist from the \ldblquote back\rdblquote  and can\rquote 
