\par \tab Commuting via this power is disorienting. Indeed, a traveler emerges dazed and can\rquote 
t attack or move for a round. Even just poking a head through a door requires a system shock roll. Failure means the hero loses 50% of his current hit points and passes out for 1d6 rounds. Attacks made through a door suffer a \endash 
